    "citation": [
      "Roebuck Jr., Myers-Pigg, Regier, Ward, Cooper, Kemner, Marcarelli, Minor, Philben, Song, Vargas, Zheng, and EXCHANGE Consortium (2025). \"Differences in dissolved organic matter composition between rivers and estuaries is conserved across freshwater and saltwater coastal regions\", submitted to PLOS Water.",
      "Myers-Pigg AN, Pennington SC, Homolka KK, Lewis AM, Otenburg O, Patel KF, et al. Biogeochemistry of upland to wetland soils, sediments, and surface waters across Mid-Atlantic and Great Lakes coastal interfaces. Sci Data. 2023 Nov 24;10(1):822. https://doi.org/10.1038/s41597-023-02548-7.",
      "Pennington S C ; Alford S ; Back M P ; Bailey V ; Baldwin A ; Bolinger J ; Bowe M ; Boyanov M I ; Cianci-Gaskill J A ; Conroy N A ; Cooper M J ; Day D ; Demeo A ; Derby K ; Detweiler D ; Devres-Zimmerman S ; Eberhard E ; Gedan K ; Haaf L ; Homolka K K ; Johnson E ; Kemner K M ; Khan A ; Kirwan M ; Kittaka P ; Koontz E ; Langley A ; Leff R ; Lerberg S ; Lewis A M ; Malkin S ; Marcarelli A M ; McMurray S E ; Messerschmidt T ; Michael T C ; Michael H A ; Minor E C ; Moye B ; Mozdzer T J ; Neubauer S ; Norris C G ; O'Loughlin E J ; Otenburg O ; Pain A ; Patel K F ; Philben M ; Phillips E ; Pratt D ; Regier P ; Roebuck Jr. J A ; Sage L ; Sandborn D ; Smith S ; Smith A ; Soin-Voshell S ; Song B ; Sprague-Getsy A ; St. Laurent K ; Staver L ; Stearns A ; Stetten L ; Swerida R ; Theuerkauf E J ; Tully K ; Vargas R ; Ward N D ; Watson E ; Weilminster C ; Myers-Pigg A N (2023): EXCHANGE Campaign 1: A Community-Driven Baseline Characterization of Soils, Sediments, and Water Across Coastal Gradients. COMPASS-FME, ESS-DIVE repository. Dataset. https://doi.org/10.15485/1960313."
    ],
